# Exclude credentials from Docker build context
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/test-artifacts
**/coverage
*.log
# dist/maestro and infra/runtime are required by Dockerfiles.
